 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The syntactic function of the expletive \"es\"",
     "texto": [
      "When an impersonal passive sentence lacks a grammatical subject, the pronoun **es** can be placed in the first position (**Vorfeld**) to ensure that the conjugated verb occupies the compulsory second syntactic position (**V2**): **Es wurde bis spät in die Nacht über das Vorhaben verhandelt** (it was negotiated about the project until late into the night)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Rule for eliding the expletive pronoun",
     "texto": [
      "This **es** is not a genuine referential pronoun, but a mere syntactic placeholder (**Platzhalter**). If any other sentence element (a temporal adverb, a prepositional complement or a dative) comes to occupy the first position, the pronoun **es** disappears compulsorily: compared with **Es wurde lange über das Gesetz gestritten**, with inversion one says **Über das Gesetz wurde lange gestritten**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Positional structure",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Status of the pronoun es",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Example",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
     "filas": [
